        "id": 1121210
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-11-09T02:35:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed, mpu_protect_ram() already did the same thing in commom/system.c. I think this part is useless.",
      "parentUuid": "75b2aee9_fbac9eb7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 57,
        "startChar": 1,
